{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60000 years in the future , the old empire is on the brink of collapse. You and five other pilots are the last thing standing between a dying way of life and total annihilation. Shoot command and bomb your way through multiple unique stages, you are our last hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A system that allows you to play as an entire squad at the same time by switching ships and commanding bombers that unleash a devastating screen-clearing attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless and boss rush mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat with a unique sense of speed and style, you can learn each enemy's weaknesses and which ship is best suited to counter them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10  stages each containing a unique boss and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite lives/lives mode, you can play this game like an old arcade cabinet or you can go through each level at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This game is in its early stages content is likely to Change/not end up in the final game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3671780?t=1760073592","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671780/2b3ec1cc645cd480a2426d72755a6f082ae5aa8f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760073592","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671780/27ed5aceb7cbb1d7e72e4a41469bf7b52680329d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760073592","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671780/27ed5aceb7cbb1d7e72e4a41469bf7b52680329d/capsule_184x69.jp